  "description": "Pure C# .NET 10 LLM fine-tuning, PEFT (LoRA / QLoRA), continual learning Sleep consolidation, pre-allocated MoE expansion, and model alignment engine. Direct GGUF zero-copy memory-mapping, zero-allocation Autograd backpropagation, and instant adapter fusion.",
