  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0: Introduces Continual Learning Sleep Consolidation Pipeline and Pre-allocated MoE Parameter Expansion (arXiv:2606.03979). Implements PreallocatedMoeExpansionBank with 64-byte aligned unmanaged slots and SIMD Top-k routing, DreamQualityFilter with AVX2 SIMD Levenshtein edit distance and cosine similarity filtering, and SleepConsolidationTrainer with 3-phase biological consolidation (Dreaming, Generalized Knowledge Distillation / GKD with beta-divergence, and Synaptic Pruning). Updates Glacier.Inference dependency to v1.5.0 and Glacier.Tensor to v1.1.0.",
